{"1":{"w":[{"c":"حمٓ","d":"ha-meem","e":"Ha Meem"}],"a":{"g":"Ha, Meem."}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْكِتَابِ","d":"wal-kitābi","e":"By the Book"},{"c":"الْمُبِينِ","d":"l-mubīni","e":"the clear"}],"a":{"g":"By the clear Book,"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"أَنْزَلْنَاهُ","d":"anzalnāhu","e":"revealed it"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"لَيْلَةٍ","d":"laylatin","e":"a Night"},{"c":"مُبَارَكَةٍ","d":"mubārakatin","e":"Blessed"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"كُنَّا","d":"kunnā","e":"[We] are"},{"c":"مُنْذِرِينَ","d":"mundhirīna","e":"(ever) warning"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We sent it down during a blessed night. Indeed, We were to warn [mankind]."}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"Therein"},{"c":"يُفْرَقُ","d":"yuf'raqu","e":"is made distinct"},{"c":"كُلُّ","d":"kullu","e":"every"},{"c":"أَمْرٍ","d":"amrin","e":"affair"},{"c":"حَكِيمٍ","d":"ḥakīmin","e":"wise"}],"a":{"g":"On that night is made distinct every precise matter -"}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْرًا","d":"amran","e":"A command"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"عِنْدِنَا","d":"ʿindinā","e":"Us"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"كُنَّا","d":"kunnā","e":"[We] are"},{"c":"مُرْسِلِينَ","d":"mur'silīna","e":"(ever) sending"}],"a":{"g":"[Every] matter [proceeding] from Us. Indeed, We were to send [a messenger]"}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"رَحْمَةً","d":"raḥmatan","e":"As Mercy"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed He"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"[He]"},{"c":"السَّمِيعُ","d":"l-samīʿu","e":"(is) the All-Hearer"},{"c":"الْعَلِيمُ","d":"l-ʿalīmu","e":"the All-Knower"}],"a":{"g":"As mercy from your Lord. Indeed, He is the Hearing, the Knowing."}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"رَبِّ","d":"rabbi","e":"Lord"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"(of) the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضِ","d":"wal-arḍi","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and whatever"},{"c":"بَيْنَهُمَا","d":"baynahumā","e":"(is) between both of them"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you"},{"c":"مُوقِنِينَ","d":"mūqinīna","e":"would be certain"}],"a":{"g":"Lord of the heavens and the earth and that between them, if you would be certain."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(There is) no"},{"c":"إِلَهَ","d":"ilāha","e":"god"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"Him"},{"c":"يُحْيِي","d":"yuḥ'yī","e":"He gives life"},{"c":"وَيُمِيتُ","d":"wayumītu","e":"and causes death"},{"c":"رَبُّكُمْ","d":"rabbukum","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"وَرَبُّ","d":"warabbu","e":"and (the) Lord"},{"c":"ءَابَائِكُمُ","d":"ābāikumu","e":"(of) your fathers"},{"c":"الْأَوَّلِينَ","d":"l-awalīna","e":"the former"}],"a":{"g":"There is no deity except Him; He gives life and causes death. [He is] your Lord and the Lord of your first forefathers."}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"Nay"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"they"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(are) in"},{"c":"شَكٍّ","d":"shakkin","e":"doubt"},{"c":"يَلْعَبُونَ","d":"yalʿabūna","e":"playing"}],"a":{"g":"But they are in doubt, amusing themselves."}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"فَارْتَقِبْ","d":"fa-ir'taqib","e":"Then watch"},{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(for the) Day"},{"c":"تَأْتِي","d":"tatī","e":"(when) will bring"},{"c":"السَّمَاءُ","d":"l-samāu","e":"the sky"},{"c":"بِدُخَانٍ","d":"bidukhānin","e":"smoke"},{"c":"مُبِينٍ","d":"mubīnin","e":"visible"}],"a":{"g":"Then watch for the Day when the sky will bring a visible smoke."}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"يَغْشَى","d":"yaghshā","e":"Enveloping"},{"c":"النَّاسَ","d":"l-nāsa","e":"the people"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"عَذَابٌ","d":"ʿadhābun","e":"(will be) a punishment"},{"c":"أَلِيمٌ","d":"alīmun","e":"painful"}],"a":{"g":"Covering the people; this is a painful torment."}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"رَبَّنَا","d":"rabbanā","e":"Our Lord!"},{"c":"اكْشِفْ","d":"ik'shif","e":"Remove"},{"c":"عَنَّا","d":"ʿannā","e":"from us"},{"c":"الْعَذَابَ","d":"l-ʿadhāba","e":"the punishment"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"indeed we"},{"c":"مُؤْمِنُونَ","d":"mu'minūna","e":"(are) believers"}],"a":{"g":"[They will say], \"Our Lord, remove from us the torment; indeed, we are believers.\""}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"أَنَّى","d":"annā","e":"How can"},{"c":"لَهُمُ","d":"lahumu","e":"(there be) for them"},{"c":"الذِّكْرَى","d":"l-dhik'rā","e":"the reminder"},{"c":"وَقَدْ","d":"waqad","e":"when verily"},{"c":"جَاءَهُمْ","d":"jāahum","e":"had come to them"},{"c":"رَسُولٌ","d":"rasūlun","e":"a Messenger"},{"c":"مُبِينٌ","d":"mubīnun","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"How will there be for them a reminder [at that time]? And there had come to them a clear Messenger."}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"تَوَلَّوْا","d":"tawallaw","e":"they turned away"},{"c":"عَنْهُ","d":"ʿanhu","e":"from him"},{"c":"وَقَالُوا","d":"waqālū","e":"and said"},{"c":"مُعَلَّمٌ","d":"muʿallamun","e":"One taught"},{"c":"مَجْنُونٌ","d":"majnūnun","e":"a mad man"}],"a":{"g":"Then they turned away from him and said, \"[He was] taught [and is] a madman.\""}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"كَاشِفُوا","d":"kāshifū","e":"(will) remove"},{"c":"الْعَذَابِ","d":"l-ʿadhābi","e":"the punishment"},{"c":"قَلِيلًا","d":"qalīlan","e":"a little"},{"c":"إِنَّكُمْ","d":"innakum","e":"indeed you"},{"c":"عَائِدُونَ","d":"ʿāidūna","e":"(will) return"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We will remove the torment for a little. Indeed, you [disbelievers] will return [to disbelief]."}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"نَبْطِشُ","d":"nabṭishu","e":"We will seize"},{"c":"الْبَطْشَةَ","d":"l-baṭshata","e":"(with) the seizure"},{"c":"الْكُبْرَى","d":"l-kub'rā","e":"the greatest"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"indeed We"},{"c":"مُنْتَقِمُونَ","d":"muntaqimūna","e":"(will) take retribution"}],"a":{"g":"The Day We will strike with the greatest assault, indeed, We will take retribution."}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"فَتَنَّا","d":"fatannā","e":"We tried"},{"c":"قَبْلَهُمْ","d":"qablahum","e":"before them"},{"c":"قَوْمَ","d":"qawma","e":"(the) people"},{"c":"فِرْعَوْنَ","d":"fir'ʿawna","e":"(of) Firaun"},{"c":"وَجَاءَهُمْ","d":"wajāahum","e":"and came to them"},{"c":"رَسُولٌ","d":"rasūlun","e":"a Messenger"},{"c":"كَرِيمٌ","d":"karīmun","e":"noble"}],"a":{"g":"And We had already tried before them the people of Pharaoh, and there came to them a noble messenger,"}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"That"},{"c":"أَدُّوا","d":"addū","e":"Deliver"},{"c":"إِلَيَّ","d":"ilayya","e":"to me"},{"c":"عِبَادَ","d":"ʿibāda","e":"(the) servants"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"إِنِّي","d":"innī","e":"Indeed I am"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"to you"},{"c":"رَسُولٌ","d":"rasūlun","e":"a Messenger"},{"c":"أَمِينٌ","d":"amīnun","e":"trustworthy"}],"a":{"g":"[Saying], \"Render to me the servants of Allah. Indeed, I am to you a trustworthy messenger,\""}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَنْ","d":"wa-an","e":"And that"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(do) not"},{"c":"تَعْلُوا","d":"taʿlū","e":"exalt yourselves"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"against"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"إِنِّي","d":"innī","e":"Indeed I"},{"c":"ءَاتِيكُمْ","d":"ātīkum","e":"[I] have come to you"},{"c":"بِسُلْطَانٍ","d":"bisul'ṭānin","e":"with an authority"},{"c":"مُبِينٍ","d":"mubīnin","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"And [saying], \"Be not haughty with Allah. Indeed, I have come to you with clear authority."}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنِّي","d":"wa-innī","e":"And indeed I"},{"c":"عُذْتُ","d":"ʿudh'tu","e":"[I] seek refuge"},{"c":"بِرَبِّي","d":"birabbī","e":"with my Lord"},{"c":"وَرَبِّكُمْ","d":"warabbikum","e":"and your Lord"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"lest"},{"c":"تَرْجُمُونِ","d":"tarjumūni","e":"you stone me"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, I have sought refuge in my Lord and your Lord, lest you stone me."}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنْ","d":"wa-in","e":"And if"},{"c":"لَمْ","d":"lam","e":"not"},{"c":"تُؤْمِنُوا","d":"tu'minū","e":"you believe"},{"c":"لِي","d":"lī","e":"me"},{"c":"فَاعْتَزِلُونِ","d":"fa-iʿ'tazilūni","e":"then leave me alone"}],"a":{"g":"But if you do not believe me, then leave me alone.\""}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"فَدَعَا","d":"fadaʿā","e":"So he called"},{"c":"رَبَّهُ","d":"rabbahu","e":"his Lord"},{"c":"أَنَّ","d":"anna","e":"That"},{"c":"هَؤُلَاءِ","d":"hāulāi","e":"these"},{"c":"قَوْمٌ","d":"qawmun","e":"(are) a people"},{"c":"مُجْرِمُونَ","d":"muj'rimūna","e":"criminals"}],"a":{"g":"And [finally] he called to his Lord that these were a criminal people."}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَسْرِ","d":"fa-asri","e":"Then Set out"},{"c":"بِعِبَادِي","d":"biʿibādī","e":"with My slaves"},{"c":"لَيْلًا","d":"laylan","e":"(by) night"},{"c":"إِنَّكُمْ","d":"innakum","e":"Indeed you"},{"c":"مُتَّبَعُونَ","d":"muttabaʿūna","e":"(will be) followed"}],"a":{"g":"[Allah said], \"Then set out with My servants by night. Indeed, you are to be pursued."}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"وَاتْرُكِ","d":"wa-ut'ruki","e":"And leave"},{"c":"الْبَحْرَ","d":"l-baḥra","e":"the sea"},{"c":"رَهْوًا","d":"rahwan","e":"at rest"},{"c":"إِنَّهُمْ","d":"innahum","e":"Indeed they"},{"c":"جُنْدٌ","d":"jundun","e":"(are) an army"},{"c":"مُغْرَقُونَ","d":"mugh'raqūna","e":"(to be) drowned"}],"a":{"g":"And leave the sea in stillness. Indeed, they are an army to be drowned.\""}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"كَمْ","d":"kam","e":"How many"},{"c":"تَرَكُوا","d":"tarakū","e":"(did) they leave"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"جَنَّاتٍ","d":"jannātin","e":"gardens"},{"c":"وَعُيُونٍ","d":"waʿuyūnin","e":"and springs"}],"a":{"g":"How much they left behind of gardens and springs"}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"وَزُرُوعٍ","d":"wazurūʿin","e":"And cornfields"},{"c":"وَمَقَامٍ","d":"wamaqāmin","e":"and places"},{"c":"كَرِيمٍ","d":"karīmin","e":"noble"}],"a":{"g":"And crops and noble sites"}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"وَنَعْمَةٍ","d":"wanaʿmatin","e":"And pleasant things"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they used (to)"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"فَاكِهِينَ","d":"fākihīna","e":"take delight!"}],"a":{"g":"And comfort wherein they were amused."}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"كَذَلِكَ","d":"kadhālika","e":"Thus"},{"c":"وَأَوْرَثْنَاهَا","d":"wa-awrathnāhā","e":"And We made it (an) inherit(ance)"},{"c":"قَوْمًا","d":"qawman","e":"(for) a people"},{"c":"ءَاخَرِينَ","d":"ākharīna","e":"another"}],"a":{"g":"Thus. And We caused to inherit it another people."}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"فَمَا","d":"famā","e":"And not"},{"c":"بَكَتْ","d":"bakat","e":"wept"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمُ","d":"ʿalayhimu","e":"for them"},{"c":"السَّمَاءُ","d":"l-samāu","e":"the heaven"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضُ","d":"wal-arḍu","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they were"},{"c":"مُنْظَرِينَ","d":"munẓarīna","e":"given respite"}],"a":{"g":"And the heaven and earth wept not for them, nor were they reprieved."}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"نَجَّيْنَا","d":"najjaynā","e":"We saved"},{"c":"بَنِي","d":"banī","e":"(the) Children of Israel"},{"c":"إِسْرَاءِيلَ","d":"is'rāīla","e":"(the) Children of Israel"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"الْعَذَابِ","d":"l-ʿadhābi","e":"the punishment"},{"c":"الْمُهِينِ","d":"l-muhīni","e":"the humiliating"}],"a":{"g":"And We certainly saved the Children of Israel from the humiliating torment -"}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"From"},{"c":"فِرْعَوْنَ","d":"fir'ʿawna","e":"Firaun"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed he"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"was"},{"c":"عَالِيًا","d":"ʿāliyan","e":"arrogant"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"among"},{"c":"الْمُسْرِفِينَ","d":"l-mus'rifīna","e":"the transgressors"}],"a":{"g":"From Pharaoh. Indeed, he was a haughty one among the transgressors."}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدِ","d":"walaqadi","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"اخْتَرْنَاهُمْ","d":"ikh'tarnāhum","e":"We chose them"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"by"},{"c":"عِلْمٍ","d":"ʿil'min","e":"knowledge"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"over"},{"c":"الْعَالَمِينَ","d":"l-ʿālamīna","e":"the worlds"}],"a":{"g":"And We certainly chose them by knowledge over [all] the worlds."}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"وَءَاتَيْنَاهُمْ","d":"waātaynāhum","e":"And We gave them"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْءَايَاتِ","d":"l-āyāti","e":"the Signs"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"that"},{"c":"فِيهِ","d":"fīhi","e":"in it"},{"c":"بَلَؤٌا","d":"balāon","e":"(was) a trial"},{"c":"مُبِينٌ","d":"mubīnun","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"And We gave them of signs that in which there was a clear trial."}},"34":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"هَؤُلَاءِ","d":"hāulāi","e":"these"},{"c":"لَيَقُولُونَ","d":"layaqūlūna","e":"surely they say"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, these [disbelievers] are saying,"}},"35":{"w":[{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"Not"},{"c":"هِيَ","d":"hiya","e":"it"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"(is) but"},{"c":"مَوْتَتُنَا","d":"mawtatunā","e":"our death"},{"c":"الْأُولَى","d":"l-ūlā","e":"the first"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"we"},{"c":"بِمُنْشَرِينَ","d":"bimunsharīna","e":"(will be) raised again"}],"a":{"g":"\"There is not but our first death, and we will not be resurrected."}},"36":{"w":[{"c":"فَأْتُوا","d":"fatū","e":"Then bring"},{"c":"بِءَابَائِنَا","d":"biābāinā","e":"our forefathers"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you are"},{"c":"صَادِقِينَ","d":"ṣādiqīna","e":"truthful"}],"a":{"g":"Then bring [back] our forefathers, if you should be truthful.\""}},"37":{"w":[{"c":"أَهُمْ","d":"ahum","e":"Are they"},{"c":"خَيْرٌ","d":"khayrun","e":"better"},{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"or"},{"c":"قَوْمُ","d":"qawmu","e":"(the) people"},{"c":"تُبَّعٍ","d":"tubbaʿin","e":"(of) Tubba"},{"c":"وَالَّذِينَ","d":"wa-alladhīna","e":"and those"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"before them"},{"c":"قَبْلِهِمْ","d":"qablihim","e":"before them"},{"c":"أَهْلَكْنَاهُمْ","d":"ahlaknāhum","e":"We destroyed them"},{"c":"إِنَّهُمْ","d":"innahum","e":"indeed, they"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"were"},{"c":"مُجْرِمِينَ","d":"muj'rimīna","e":"criminals"}],"a":{"g":"Are they better or the people of Tubba' and those before them? We destroyed them, [for] indeed, they were criminals."}},"38":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"خَلَقْنَا","d":"khalaqnā","e":"We created"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضَ","d":"wal-arḍa","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and whatever"},{"c":"بَيْنَهُمَا","d":"baynahumā","e":"(is) between them"},{"c":"لَاعِبِينَ","d":"lāʿibīna","e":"(in) play"}],"a":{"g":"And We did not create the heavens and earth and that between them in play."}},"39":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"خَلَقْنَاهُمَا","d":"khalaqnāhumā","e":"We created both of them"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"بِالْحَقِّ","d":"bil-ḥaqi","e":"in [the] truth"},{"c":"وَلَكِنَّ","d":"walākinna","e":"but"},{"c":"أَكْثَرَهُمْ","d":"aktharahum","e":"most of them"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(do) not"},{"c":"يَعْلَمُونَ","d":"yaʿlamūna","e":"know"}],"a":{"g":"We did not create them except in truth, but most of them do not know."}},"40":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(the) Day of Judgment"},{"c":"الْفَصْلِ","d":"l-faṣli","e":"(the) Day of Judgment"},{"c":"مِيقَاتُهُمْ","d":"mīqātuhum","e":"(is) an appointed term for them"},{"c":"أَجْمَعِينَ","d":"ajmaʿīna","e":"all"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, the Day of Judgement is the appointed time for them all -"}},"41":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"يُغْنِي","d":"yugh'nī","e":"will avail"},{"c":"مَوْلًى","d":"mawlan","e":"a relation"},{"c":"عَنْ","d":"ʿan","e":"for"},{"c":"مَوْلًى","d":"mawlan","e":"a relation"},{"c":"شَيْئًا","d":"shayan","e":"anything"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"they"},{"c":"يُنْصَرُونَ","d":"yunṣarūna","e":"will be helped"}],"a":{"g":"The Day when no relation will avail a relation at all, nor will they be helped -"}},"42":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"Except"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(on) whom"},{"c":"رَحِمَ","d":"raḥima","e":"Allah has mercy"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah has mercy"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed, He"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"[He]"},{"c":"الْعَزِيزُ","d":"l-ʿazīzu","e":"(is) the All-Mighty"},{"c":"الرَّحِيمُ","d":"l-raḥīmu","e":"the Most Merciful"}],"a":{"g":"Except those [believers] on whom Allah has mercy. Indeed, He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful."}},"43":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"شَجَرَتَ","d":"shajarata","e":"(the) tree"},{"c":"الزَّقُّومِ","d":"l-zaqūmi","e":"(of) Zaqqum"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, the tree of zaqqum"}},"44":{"w":[{"c":"طَعَامُ","d":"ṭaʿāmu","e":"(Will be) food"},{"c":"الْأَثِيمِ","d":"l-athīmi","e":"(of) the sinner(s)"}],"a":{"g":"Is food for the sinful."}},"45":{"w":[{"c":"كَالْمُهْلِ","d":"kal-muh'li","e":"Like the murky oil"},{"c":"يَغْلِي","d":"yaghlī","e":"it will boil"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْبُطُونِ","d":"l-buṭūni","e":"the bellies"}],"a":{"g":"Like murky oil, it boils within bellies"}},"46":{"w":[{"c":"كَغَلْيِ","d":"kaghalyi","e":"Like boiling"},{"c":"الْحَمِيمِ","d":"l-ḥamīmi","e":"(of) scalding water"}],"a":{"g":"Like the boiling of scalding water."}},"47":{"w":[{"c":"خُذُوهُ","d":"khudhūhu","e":"Seize him"},{"c":"فَاعْتِلُوهُ","d":"fa-iʿ'tilūhu","e":"and drag him"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"into"},{"c":"سَوَاءِ","d":"sawāi","e":"(the) midst"},{"c":"الْجَحِيمِ","d":"l-jaḥīmi","e":"(of) the Hellfire"}],"a":{"g":"[It will be commanded], \"Seize him and drag him into the midst of the Hellfire,"}},"48":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"صُبُّوا","d":"ṣubbū","e":"pour"},{"c":"فَوْقَ","d":"fawqa","e":"over"},{"c":"رَأْسِهِ","d":"rasihi","e":"his head"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"عَذَابِ","d":"ʿadhābi","e":"(the) punishment"},{"c":"الْحَمِيمِ","d":"l-ḥamīmi","e":"(of) the scalding water"}],"a":{"g":"Then pour over his head from the torment of scalding water.\""}},"49":{"w":[{"c":"ذُقْ","d":"dhuq","e":"Taste!"},{"c":"إِنَّكَ","d":"innaka","e":"Indeed you"},{"c":"أَنْتَ","d":"anta","e":"[you] (were)"},{"c":"الْعَزِيزُ","d":"l-ʿazīzu","e":"the mighty"},{"c":"الْكَرِيمُ","d":"l-karīmu","e":"the noble"}],"a":{"g":"[It will be said], \"Taste! Indeed, you are the honored, the noble!"}},"50":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"this"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"(is) what"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you used (to)"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"[about it]"},{"c":"تَمْتَرُونَ","d":"tamtarūna","e":"doubt"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, this is what you used to dispute.\""}},"51":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الْمُتَّقِينَ","d":"l-mutaqīna","e":"the righteous"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(will be) in"},{"c":"مَقَامٍ","d":"maqāmin","e":"a place"},{"c":"أَمِينٍ","d":"amīnin","e":"secure"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, the righteous will be in a secure place;"}},"52":{"w":[{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"In"},{"c":"جَنَّاتٍ","d":"jannātin","e":"gardens"},{"c":"وَعُيُونٍ","d":"waʿuyūnin","e":"and springs"}],"a":{"g":"Within gardens and springs,"}},"53":{"w":[{"c":"يَلْبَسُونَ","d":"yalbasūna","e":"Wearing garments"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"سُنْدُسٍ","d":"sundusin","e":"fine silk"},{"c":"وَإِسْتَبْرَقٍ","d":"wa-is'tabraqin","e":"and heavy silk"},{"c":"مُتَقَابِلِينَ","d":"mutaqābilīna","e":"facing each other"}],"a":{"g":"Wearing [garments of] fine silk and brocade, facing each other."}},"54":{"w":[{"c":"كَذَلِكَ","d":"kadhālika","e":"Thus"},{"c":"وَزَوَّجْنَاهُمْ","d":"wazawwajnāhum","e":"And We will marry them"},{"c":"بِحُورٍ","d":"biḥūrin","e":"(to) companions with beautiful eyes"},{"c":"عِينٍ","d":"ʿīnin","e":"(to) companions with beautiful eyes"}],"a":{"g":"Thus. And We will marry them to fair women with large, [beautiful] eyes."}},"55":{"w":[{"c":"يَدْعُونَ","d":"yadʿūna","e":"They will call"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"بِكُلِّ","d":"bikulli","e":"for every kind"},{"c":"فَاكِهَةٍ","d":"fākihatin","e":"(of) fruit"},{"c":"ءَامِنِينَ","d":"āminīna","e":"secure"}],"a":{"g":"They will call therein for every [kind of] fruit - safe and secure."}},"56":{"w":[{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"Not"},{"c":"يَذُوقُونَ","d":"yadhūqūna","e":"they will taste"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"الْمَوْتَ","d":"l-mawta","e":"the death"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"الْمَوْتَةَ","d":"l-mawtata","e":"the death"},{"c":"الْأُولَى","d":"l-ūlā","e":"the first"},{"c":"وَوَقَاهُمْ","d":"wawaqāhum","e":"And He will protect them"},{"c":"عَذَابَ","d":"ʿadhāba","e":"(from the) punishment"},{"c":"الْجَحِيمِ","d":"l-jaḥīmi","e":"(of) the Hellfire"}],"a":{"g":"They will not taste death therein except the first death, and He will have protected them from the punishment of Hellfire"}},"57":{"w":[{"c":"فَضْلًا","d":"faḍlan","e":"A Bounty"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"That"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"it"},{"c":"الْفَوْزُ","d":"l-fawzu","e":"(will be) the success"},{"c":"الْعَظِيمُ","d":"l-ʿaẓīmu","e":"the great"}],"a":{"g":"As bounty from your Lord. That is what is the great attainment."}},"58":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِنَّمَا","d":"fa-innamā","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"يَسَّرْنَاهُ","d":"yassarnāhu","e":"We have made it easy"},{"c":"بِلِسَانِكَ","d":"bilisānika","e":"in your tongue"},{"c":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","d":"laʿallahum","e":"so that they may"},{"c":"يَتَذَكَّرُونَ","d":"yatadhakkarūna","e":"take heed"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, We have eased the Qur'an in your tongue that they might be reminded."}},"59":{"w":[{"c":"فَارْتَقِبْ","d":"fa-ir'taqib","e":"So watch"},{"c":"إِنَّهُمْ","d":"innahum","e":"indeed they"},{"c":"مُرْتَقِبُونَ","d":"mur'taqibūna","e":"(too are) watching"}],"a":{"g":"So watch, [O Muhammad]; indeed, they are watching [for your end]."}}}